
Terminal setup

We have placed .profile files into /usr/guest and /.
These automatically are run by /bin/sh when you login.

.cshrc files have been placed in /usr/guest2 and /.
We also have placed .login files there.
These automatically are run by /bin/csh when you login.

We have set backspace and line-kill.

You may use these as models for other ids.
